+/**
+ * vm_mmap_remote - install a file (or anonymous) mapping into @mm, without
+ * target-side cooperation.
+ * @mm: Target mm; caller holds a reference (e.g. get_task_mm()).
+ * @file: Backing file, or NULL for an anonymous mapping.
